th lap, Costantini was on lap 38 and Vizcaya was stranded in his pit with supercharger problems and retired on lap 46 with a broken piston.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":55,"text":"Costantini stops every other lap to cool his head and soak his cap in cold water.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":56,"text":"Costantini knew that at a higher pace -like Vizcaya- he would not bring the Bugatti to the finish. Therefore he drove considerably slower and more carefully","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":65,"text":"Goux turned his laps regularly without any problems from his engine.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":75,"text":"Goux keeps up a modest pace; Costantini is about 12 seconds a lap slower.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":100,"text":"Goux wins; Costantini, 16 laps behind, is flagged off.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":100,"text":"Goux made a lap of honor and stopped at the stand where the crowd rewarded the winner with a large ovation.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0}]}